:agent="v1"><span begin="1:47.140" end="1:50.297">Evanghelia</span> <span begin="1:50.297" end="1:50.929">cea</span> <span begin="1:50.929" end="1:52.192">vie</span></p><p begin="1:52.192" end="1:54.799" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:52.192" end="1:54.717">Luminează</span> <span begin="1:54.717" end="1:54.799">tuturor!</span></p><p begin="1:54.799" end="1:59.800" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:54.799" end="1:55.424">Ori</span> <span begin="1:55.424" end="1:56.049">ești</span> <span begin="1:56.049" end="1:57.299">rece,</span> <span begin="1:57.299" end="1:57.925">ori</span> <span begin="1:57.925" end="1:59.800">fierbinte,</span></p><p begin="1:59.800" end="2:04.801" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:59.800" end="2:00.425">Nu</span> <span begin="2:00.425" end="2:01.050">mai</span> <span begin="2:01.050" end="2:01.675">poți</span> <span begin="2:01.675" end="2:02.300">fi</span> <span begin="2:02.300" end="2:04.801">căldicel.</span></p><p begin="2:04.801" end="2:09.802" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:04.801" end="2:05.426">Ai</span> <span begin="2:05.426" end="2:06.051">pe</span> <span begin="2:06.051" end="2:07.301">mână</span> <span begin="2:07.301" end="2:07.927">și</span> <span begin="2:07.927" end="2:08.552">pe</span> <span begin="2:08.552" end="2:09.802">frunte</span></p><p begin="2:09.802" end="2:14.803" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:09.802" end="2:10.427">Semn</span> <span begin="2:10.427" end="2:11.052">de</span> <span begin="2:11.052" end="2:12.302">fiară</span> <span begin="2:12.302" end="2:12.928">sau</span> <span begin="2:12.928" end="2:13.553">de</span> <span begin="2:13.553" end="2:14.803">Miel.</span></p></div></body></tt>